exit: 0
--- stdout
Managed Redis

Usage:
  cloudru-dbaas redis [command]

Available Commands:
  clusters    Redis clusters
  operations  Cluster operations
  roles       Cluster roles
  specs       Cluster specifications
  users       Cluster users
  versions    Redis versions

Flags:
      --api-url string   Redis Public API URL
  -h, --help             help for redis

Global Flags:
      --config string      config file (default $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cloudru-dbaas/config.yaml or ~/.config/cloudru-dbaas/config.yaml; also CLOUDRU_CONFIG)
      --json               output JSON (for scripts and agents)
      --profile string     profile from the config file (also CLOUDRU_PROFILE; default: profile: in the file, then default)
      --project string     cloud.ru project id
      --timeout duration   time limit for --wait (default 30m0s)

Use "cloudru-dbaas redis [command] --help" for more information about a command.
